insta (the Meadow package) is a port of the Rust crate insta
(https://github.com/mitsuhiko/insta), version 1.48.0, by Armin Ronacher and
contributors, to Meadow. It includes a port of the YAML emitter and reader
insta vendors from yaml-rust (https://github.com/chyh1990/yaml-rust), by
Yuheng Chen and contributors, and prints with the styles of the console crate
(https://github.com/console-rs/console). Its test cases are generated from
insta, and its code is translated from its source.

